title: Agent Loop
text: Two agents, each sealed in with what it knows. Neither says anything it wasn't asked, and all you can ask about is red.
trick: a gate's output may be fed back to its own input: yellow AND red answers red; red through a doppler is the green question that makes yellow answer in full and cyan answer at all. The ring grows
motif: a data centre: racks of occupied squares with aisles, two sealed models each feeding a gate
expect: recolours>=1
